(The Verified Package is a monthly verification and audit service supplied at a fee of £50 per calendar month \(the Fee\). The) Tj
T* (Fee constitutes consideration for the verification services described herein. It does not constitute a purchase of, or) Tj
T* (entitlement to, any TrustScore, rating, band, or numerical value. Verified Entity \(+15\): ViralPeps shall verify the Subscriber's) Tj
T* (legal business identity \(a company registered at Companies House or a sole trader\) and shall confirm that the Subscriber) Tj
T* (accepts real-money payment by card or bank transfer. Domain Verification \(+15\): provided at no additional charge; the) Tj
T* (Subscriber shall install the TrustScore badge on its website, linked to viralpeps.co.uk, and ViralPeps shall confirm the) Tj
T* (Subscriber's ownership and operation of the relevant domain. Recertification: ViralPeps shall re-verify the Subscriber's entity) Tj
T* (and payment particulars at intervals of twelve \(12\) months. TrustScores are not offered for sale; the Fee is payable in) Tj
T* (respect of the audit performed, and any points are awarded solely upon verification of the underlying facts.) Tj
