(£50 per month by Direct Debit \(standard rate\), the first thirty \(30\) days of which are free of charge; or £60 per month by bank) Tj
T* (transfer \(the higher rate reflects the additional administrative cost of manual collection\). During the free-of-charge period, the) Tj
T* (verification shall proceed and the TrustScore shall be awarded in full. Following the free-of-charge period, the Fee shall be) Tj
T* (collected monthly in advance and shall continue until termination in accordance with these Terms. The Subscriber shall) Tj
T* (receive a GoCardless Direct Debit link from ViralPeps in order to establish the Direct Debit mandate. Termination requires) Tj
T* (thirty \(30\) days' written notice. Where any sum remains outstanding for more than seven \(7\) days from its due date, whether) Tj
T* (payable by Direct Debit or bank transfer, the Subscriber's TrustScore shall be suspended, subject to a maximum of 85, and) Tj
T* (an administrative late-payment fee of £10 shall become payable; the score shall be restored upon receipt of payment. Where) Tj
T* (payment is not made, the Subscriber's TrustScore shall revert to the automatically calculated score, subject to a maximum of) Tj
